# The Site Control Center lists each extension once. A pin saved twice (or two installs of one extension, two
# folders with the same manifest key) listed it twice, and the menu's icon map trapped on the repeated ID as it
# opened (four crash reports, 0.1.42 and 0.1.43, in SiteControlCenterView.liveIcons). PinnedExtensions.menuOrder
# drops the repeats; CraCore's ExtensionsMenuOrderTests has both cases.
budget rss=700 stalls50=8
extension ${FIXTURES}/Extension
# Tests/Fixtures/Extension/ID (seed lines take no variables), pinned twice.
seed pinned-extensions.json ["jeackjeedkojbpbfclolioidbpgjnnjg","jeackjeedkojbpbfclolioidbpgjnnjg"]
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=menu
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 2
cra://debug?siteControls=1
wait 2
